sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Browser as Browser (React)
    participant AuthCtx as AuthContext
    participant API as API Client
    participant Express as Express API
    participant Middleware as JWT Middleware
    participant GoTrue as GoTrue Auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Browser,DB: ─── REGISTRATION / LOGIN ───

    Browser->>AuthCtx: signIn(email, password)
    AuthCtx->>API: POST /api/auth/signin { email, pass }
    API->>Express: /api/auth/signin
    Express->>DB: SELECT user + encrypted_password
    DB-->>Express: user row
    Express->>Express: verifyPassword(pass, hash)
    Express->>Express: jwt.sign({ sub, role, ... })
    Express-->>API: { token, user }
    API-->>AuthCtx: store token + user
    AuthCtx-->>Browser: user logged in

    Note over Browser,DB: ─── BOOKING FLOW (authenticated) ───

    Browser->>API: GET /api/experiences
    API->>Express: /api/experiences
    Express->>DB: SELECT * FROM experiences
    DB-->>Express: 4 rows
    Express-->>API: experiences[]
    API-->>Browser: render cards

    Browser->>API: POST /api/experiences/:id/book
    Note over API: JWT injected from AuthContext
    API->>Express: POST /api/bookings { expId, date, time, ... }
    Express->>Middleware: verify(JWT, JWT_SECRET)
    Middleware-->>Express: { userId, userRole }

    Express->>Express: validate body (Zod)
    Express->>DB: BEGIN
    Express->>DB: INSERT INTO bookings (id, user_id, ..., booking_ref)
    Express->>DB: INSERT INTO passport_stamps (user_id, title, ...)
    Express->>DB: COMMIT
    DB-->>Express: booking row + stamp row

    Express->>Express: generate XLR-nnnn ref
    Express-->>API: { booking, status: "Confirmed", ref: "XLR-4821" }
    API-->>Browser: confirmation screen

    Note over Browser,DB: ─── PROFILE / DASHBOARD ───

    Browser->>API: GET /api/bookings
    API->>Express: GET /api/bookings (JWT)
    Express->>Middleware: verify JWT
    Express->>DB: SELECT * FROM bookings JOIN experiences WHERE user_id = $1
    DB-->>Express: bookings[]
    Express-->>API: [{ ref, status, date, ... }]
    API-->>Browser: profile screen with history
